#: framedia.cc:454
msgid ""
"<b>Place a copy of this frame:</b><br/>When a new page is created, a frame will "
"be created for this frameset, which will always show the exact same thing as "
"the frame on the previous page. This is what happens for headers and footers, "
"but this option makes it possible to choose the same behavior for other "
"framesets, for instance a company logo and/or title that should appear exactly "
"the same on every page."
